    "summary": "Effective 2026-02-23, VA processes Survivors Pension and dependency and indemnity compensation (DIC) claims so the surviving spouse or child receives the greater benefit. VA concurrently denies Survivors Pension and awards DIC unless Survivors Pension is more beneficial, which the rule limits to a surviving spouse with no dependents who is in a nursing home and has applied for or receives Medicaid. Claims-processing rule; it does not change service connection, rating, or presumption criteria relevant to the secondary-condition knowledge base.",
    "reviewedOn": "2026-09-01"
